#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.13/site-packages/pybamm/expression_tree/vector_field.py:docstring
#: of pybamm.expression_tree.vector_field.VectorField:3
msgid ""
"VectorField is a convenience subclass of TensorField for rank-1 tensors with "
"N >= 2 components.  Components are stored by integer index; the properties "
"``lr_field`` and ``tb_field`` are aliases for ``[0]`` and ``[1]``."
msgstr ""

